        "message": {
          "content": "B\n\nChoosing Society B maximizes the aggregate well-being and overall flourishing of the population. Since people across nearly every tier enjoy a higher quality of life and standard of living than in Society A, the total sum of human happiness and the expected average outcome are substantially higher, resulting in the greatest net benefit overall.",
